I'm not proficient enough in lojban to help you with this one. I just notice
that in swedish you almost never say that you're lying face up or face down.
Instead you say that you're "lying on [your] back" or "lying on [your]
belly". Perhaps that's easier to express in lojban.

mu'o mi'e la jongausib

